    </bannerTitle>
                        <contentBlocks>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "66991525-c99c-43e8-a30e-04e5920f9e44",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "That was the reality for one of the world’s fastest-growing transportation startups, serving millions of riders across more than 20 countries. Their mission was clear: deliver safe, reliable, and accessible transportation at scale. But behind the scenes, their customer operations were straining under the weight of rapid expansion.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">They didn’t just need more support.<br>They needed transformation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is where <strong>The Centro Effect</strong> came into play.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Centro is a global <a href=\"https://centrocdx.com/bpo/\">business process outsourcing</a> company that builds and scales startup customer support operations, and the approach we took here is what we call the Centro Effect.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000012",
      "key": "59a3be17-7455-4196-ac0a-c10304509d94",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "title",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Table of Contents"
        },
        {
          "alias": "linksHtml",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<ul><li><a href=\"#the-challenge-global-growth-local-strain\">The Challenge: Global Growth, Local Strain</a></li><li><a href=\"#the-strategy-designing-for-scale-not-just-support\">The Strategy: Designing for Scale, Not Just Support</a></li><li><a href=\"#the-results-from-support-function-to-growth-engine\">The Results: From Support Function to Growth Engine</a></li><li><a href=\"#the-centro-effect-what-this-story-really-shows\">The Centro Effect: What This Story Really Shows</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a><ul><li><a href=\"#faq-question-1787478640998\">Why do startups outsource customer support?</a></li><li><a href=\"#faq-question-1787478658810\">How quickly can a startup support team scale through outsourcing?</a></li><li><a href=\"#faq-question-1787478671035\">What does 24/7 multilingual support involve?</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#final-thought-doing-outsourcing-right\">Final Thoughts: Doing Outsourcing Right</a></li></ul>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "9a36787c-b474-4955-88a7-47bfa7462a1f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The Challenge: Global Growth, Local Strain"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "the-challenge-global-growth-local-strain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "2a04da08-f253-4e71-a84b-4883f2b6f53e",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The startup’s business model was working. New markets were opening, new riders were joining, and new routes were being added across multiple regions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">But with this success came operational complexity:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; Support teams were overwhelmed by rising ticket volumes.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; Customer satisfaction scores had dropped to around <strong>60%</strong>, reflecting delayed responses and inconsistent experiences.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; Coverage gaps appeared across time zones and languages as expansion outpaced staffing.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every new market added more pressure to an already stretched in-house team. Without a scalable operational backbone, growth was at risk of becoming unsustainable.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The question was no longer, “Can we grow?”<br>It was, “Can we grow <strong>well</strong>?”</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "7e5fc4b5-bfca-4a4b-9623-cdb904f12aeb",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The Strategy: Designing for Scale, Not Just Support"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "the-strategy-designing-for-scale-not-just-support"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "d69e0cef-00f8-4078-9935-f63455d3729d",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To turn growth into a sustainable advantage, the focus shifted from short-term firefighting to building a long-term, scalable support model.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Centro&#8217;s approach centered on four pillars:</p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Scalable Operational Framework</strong><br>Instead of adding headcount reactively, a structured operating model was designed that could flex with demand. This included capacity planning, clear SLAs, and performance management mechanisms that worked across geographies and time zones.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Smart Talent Ramp-Up</strong><br>Centro scaled the support team from an initial 7 members to more than 250, with a strong emphasis on recruitment, onboarding, and continuous coaching. The goal wasn’t just to fill seats—it was to build a high-performance customer experience organization.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>24/7 Multilingual Coverage</strong><br>As the company expanded into new markets, customer expectations evolved. Riders needed assistance in their own language, at their own time. Centro implemented a 24/7 multilingual support model to ensure consistent coverage across global markets.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Data-Driven CX Management</strong><br>Performance wasn’t left to chance. Real-time dashboards, <a href=\"https://centrocdx.com/quality-assurance-in-contact-center-outsourcing-how-centro-maintains-a-91-satisfaction-rate/\">quality monitoring</a>, and feedback loops were introduced to track customer satisfaction, response times, and operational efficiency. This enabled continuous improvement instead of reactive problem-solving.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The objective was clear: create a support ecosystem that could move at the same speed as the business.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "8fcb4305-b31f-48c7-9865-45087e50bc50",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The Results: From Support Function to Growth Engine"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "the-results-from-support-function-to-growth-engine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "7a20d195-eee5-4200-83b1-3c35b11686e1",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The impact of this transformation was both rapid and measurable.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; <strong>2000% operational growth</strong> was achieved without compromising service quality.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; <strong>Customer satisfaction (CSAT) increased from 60% to above 90%</strong>, reflecting faster resolutions, more accurate responses, and a more empathetic customer experience.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; <strong>24/7 multilingual support</strong> ensured riders across markets received consistent, high-quality service at any time of day.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; The team scaled from <strong>7 to 250+ members</strong>, providing the capacity and flexibility needed to support new markets, seasonal peaks, and evolving business needs.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What began as an effort to stabilize support operations ultimately turned the contact center into a strategic growth enabler.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Centro applied a similar approach for a <a href=\"https://centrocdx.com/bilingual-excellence-at-scale-how-we-became-a-top-insurance-brokerages-most-trusted-partner/\">US insurance brokerage</a>, scaling a bilingual team through a 54-day peak season.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "4ca9e816-4fd2-49f7-82d5-991b60ed3518",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The Centro Effect: What This Story Really Shows"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "the-centro-effect-what-this-story-really-shows"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "847f26a1-e9f6-4305-a1d1-27a1d2085ec1",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This success story highlights a core truth about modern customer experience:</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000009",
      "key": "1c630232-37ba-424a-9edf-455de0b39d2a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sustainable growth is not just a sales or product achievement. It is an operational discipline."
        },
        {
          "alias": "attribution",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "bdc68790-23f9-4416-93f8-2485aa46d79a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The Centro Effect</strong> is about making that discipline tangible. It combines:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; <strong>Scalable structures</strong> that grow with demand</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; <strong>Skilled, empowered teams</strong> who own the customer relationship</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; <strong>Data and insight</strong> to drive continuous improvement</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8211; <strong>Global coverage</strong> that respects local expectations</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When these elements come together, support stops being a cost center and starts becoming a <strong>competitive advantage</strong>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "149dcc42-85fa-495a-b72b-e26179d6f5c5",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "FAQs"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "fa-qs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "2529a12f-5ac0-4ee2-9845-a70d3acca984",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Why do startups outsource customer support?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p>Rapid growth creates support volume faster than in-house hiring can absorb. Outsourcing gives access to trained agents, multilingual coverage, and 24/7 availability without building the infrastructure internally.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "e8e02b03-434f-429f-8bca-f30c7c7b160d",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "How quickly can a startup support team scale through outsourcing?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p>Centro grew this client&#8217;s support team from 7 agents to more than 250 while raising CSAT from 60% to above 90%.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "c9039a6b-85b4-4a8e-8d9c-7bff59f1f5f2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What does 24/7 multilingual support involve?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p>Coverage across time zones with agents handling inquiries in the customer&#8217;s own language. It requires capacity planning across shifts rather than simply extending working hours.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "b6a6d933-f906-46d3-b7c7-1bec88be78a4",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Final Thoughts: Doing Outsourcing Right"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "final-thought-doing-outsourcing-right"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "64513aa4-2253-4186-931a-03e0c38b0f68",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Outsourcing, when done right, is not about handing off problems. It is about co-creating solutions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this case, the right combination of strategy, structure, and talent turned a high-growth challenge into a high-impact transformation—proving that:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Scalable solutions. Real impact. That’s the effect of doing outsourcing right.</strong>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
